    "intro": [
      "HI and WELCOME to Trance Connectivity Kit 2000!!! This is my second preset pack and it is WAY better than the first one. There are {count} trance presets: big supersaw leads, gated pads and a pluck that sounds like the ceiling is coming down.",
      "I made these over the whole summer of 1999 on my mom's PC (166 MHz with MMX!!). If you make a song with them PLZ e-mail me an MP3 and I will put it on my homepage."
    ],
    "maker_note": [
      "Shoutouts to everyone in the Euphoria Trance Webring, xX_Lazer_Xx for beta testing, and my sister Jen for drawing the star on the CD.",
      "This CD is Y2K READY. I checked.",
      "PLZ SIGN MY GUESTBOOK!!! ~*~ DJ StarLite ~*~"
    ],
    "install": [
      "put the CD in. in the Library tab it shows up as TRANCEKIT2K.",
      "open a folder (Leads, Pads, Plucks...) and double click a preset.",
      "turn it UP!!!"
